# Code owners for truenorth-mcp.
#
# GitHub auto-requests a review from the owner on every pull request that changes a
# matching path. Combined with the repository ruleset that requires code-owner review,
# this makes every pull request from another author need the owner's approval. The owner
# is a bypass actor in that ruleset, so the owner can still self-merge.
#
# The last matching pattern wins. This single catch-all makes the owner the reviewer for
# the whole repository.

